sc-2-p3 : Block
sc-2-p3 = prose (cons "The machine interpretation of emitted bytes is a function of the byte vector and its calling convention. `mn-init bs args` places the bytes, arguments, call context, arena, stack, and return address into an x86 machine state. `run-to` iterates the machine transition `x86-step` until the return address is reached or the supplied fuel is exhausted. `mn-run` extracts the result only when execution reaches that address with a clear overflow flag. The resulting operations have types:" nil)
